Diagnostic package only
The optional legacy/React comparison extracts the pinned old runtime into ignored
build/visual-main. It additionally bundles mark.js v9.0.0, Julian Kühnel, MIT,
under an independent content-addressed filename. The original header is retained;
the complete license is licenses/mark.js-LICENSE.txt in that diagnostic APKG.
Source: https://github.com/julkue/mark.js
The normal React APKG does not use or bundle mark.js or the old runtime.

